: fixture: openai/reasoning-content-deepseek
: capture: synthetic
: provider: deepseek
: model: deepseek-reasoner
: captured: 2026-08-14
: source: https://api-docs.deepseek.com/api/create-chat-completion, "Chat Completion Chunk" schema, whose choices[].delta is exactly {content, reasoning_content, role} -- no `reasoning` and no `reasoning_details`. The streaming order (reasoning_content arrives first with a null content, then content arrives with a null reasoning_content) is from https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/thinking_mode, which loops `if chunk.choices[0].delta.reasoning_content: ... else: content += ...`.
: note: SYNTHETIC, and the reason it had to be. Nothing in this repo has ever talked to DeepSeek first-party -- every reasoning capture in this directory came through OpenRouter, which normalises the field to `reasoning`, which is precisely why this shape had no coverage and lost every reasoning token in silence. Envelope and field set follow the published chunk schema; the id, timestamps, fingerprint and token counts are invented, and the text is trimmed to two short sentences so the assertions can compare exact strings. Replace with a live capture the first time anyone here holds a DeepSeek key.
: request: {"model":"deepseek-reasoner","stream":true,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Think, then answer: 17 * 23."}]}

